<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Napoleon Area City SD, Ohio.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Napoleon Area City SD, Ohio.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ohio Company said it priced $6.015 million of Napoleon Area City School District, Ohio, general obligation school construct ion bonds with a top yield of 5.625 percent in 2018.</p>
</text>
